- restart-safe chronology restoration verified
- continuity-aware replay hydration verified
- append-only frontend chronology merging verified
- execution-generation chronology visibility verified
- retry-generation chronology visibility verified
- generation-boundary rendering verified

**Explicitly NOT Introduced:**
- replay execution engine
- event-sourcing authority
- replay-driven recovery
- causality synthesis
- replay-session semantics

**Impact:**
Operational survivability and historical replay continuity materially strengthened without introducing authority inversion or replay architecture drift.

**Status:** COMPLETE + VERIFIED

