**GUI Control Legality:**
PlanMutationPanel receives disabled={isExecuting}. PlanMutationPanel hidden for terminal workflows. Backend validate_step_mutable() rejects COMPLETED edits. Backend validate_workflow_mutable() rejects terminal mutations.

